      exact firez_B0_0RB0LC_1LC1RB_1RD1LA_1RD1RB.
    + exact (fireo_0RB0LC_1LC1RB_1RD1LA_1RD1RB [SRotL 1; SWin 1; SCycL 2 0; SWin 4] (StB, S0) ltac:(vm_compute; reflexivity)
